              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 5.17-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 19.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore nena kitanapat naajo, “Miloloito, miaar metua, mipurrisho, ming'uar” o kulie ake kitanapat, naa kulo rorei ooitululung. “Tonyorra ole latia ino anaa eninyor kewan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meitaas enyorrata ole latia entorrono; enkaraki ina paa enyorrata enkitabaroto oo nkitanapat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etinyikua enkolong e Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore etii nena niyiololo sii aajo kaa saa ena nchere etabawua tukul enkata pee iputunyenye aaing'uaa injo. Amu taata etataanikia iyiook enjeunoto alang enapa kata pee kinteru aairuk; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "etinyikayie enkewarie, etaa ekenyu. Ematuburukushu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Matuburukushu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ematushurtu aaiturraa",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " naa isiaaitin e naimin emaishopo masaa e wang'an; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emaitobirai ate anaa loopuo dama, neme te sikar o te merai, neme te malmalisho oo ng'uarrat torrok, neme too nkitarrikinot o to lom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake enchopo Olaitoriani Yesu Kristo, naa emintoki ake aaisho osesen erishata, metaa nena ake naayieu intabayaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
